# House of Vacation — ignore rules
#
# Scope note: this file is deliberately conservative. The website itself is
# static HTML/CSS/JS plus image, video and font assets, and ALL of it is meant
# to be tracked. Nothing below matches any website file or asset.
#
# Not ignored on purpose:
#   HOV/seo-migration/_deploy/      build output, kept by explicit decision
#   HOV/seo-migration/_backup_*/    dated backups, kept by explicit decision
#   HOV/seo-audit-export/           SEO audit CSVs
# These are already committed. If you later want them out of the repo, they
# have to be untracked as well as ignored (git rm -r --cached <path>).

# ---- Secrets and local configuration -------------------------------------
# Never commit credentials. mail.php currently hard-codes nothing, so if SMTP
# details are ever moved into a file, put them in one of these.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets.json
credentials.json

# ---- Dependency directories ----------------------------------------------
# Not present today; here so a future build step cannot commit one by accident.
node_modules/
vendor/composer/
bower_components/

# ---- Logs and temporary files --------------------------------------------
*.log
npm-debug.log*
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.swp
*~

# ---- OS cruft -------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# ---- Editor / IDE ---------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
*.sublime-workspace
*.code-workspace
